/*
  Gamification core catalogs — Czech, one line per catalog id
  (add-localization task 4.1; see CatalogL10n.swift for why these are keyed
  by id rather than by English text). Informal "ty" register, glossary:
  docs/localization-glossary.md.

  English lives in the Swift tables (Achievements.swift,
  ChallengeTemplates.swift, DailyChallenges.swift, LevelTier.swift), so
  there is deliberately no en.lproj/Catalog.strings. Every number is fixed
  per id, so each sentence is written in its final Czech form (1 den /
  2 dny / 5 dní, "ve 3 dnech" / "v 5 dnech"). CatalogCoverageTests fails
  when an id is missing here or a key here has no id any more.
*/

